{"strongs": "H6038", "word": "עֲנָוָה", "translit": "a.na.vah", "root": "ענוה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "humility:", "definition": "עֲנָוָה noun feminine humility: — Prov 15:33 + 3 t.; עַנְוָהֿ (contracted because of Maqqeph, see Br Mp ) Ps 45:5 עֶנְוָָֽתְךָ Ps 18:36 (= עֲנֹתְךָ 2Sam 22:36 see I. ענה ; read עֶזְרָֽתְךְ Ol We ); — 1. humility, meekness Ps 45:5 (dubious), Prov 15:33 ; Prov 18:12 ; Prov 22:4 ; Zeph 2:3 (probably gloss, see We Now ). 2. condescension Ps 18:36 (dubious, see above).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6211')\">BDB6211</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6037')\">H6037</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H6038')\">H6038</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6210')\">BDB6210</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6212')\">BDB6212</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עֲנָוָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>humility:</highlightword> — <ref ref=\"Prov 15:33\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,33)\">Prov 15:33</ref> + 3 t.; <bdbheb>עַנְוָהֿ</bdbheb> (contracted because of Maqqeph, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Br')\">Br<sup>Mp</sup></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Ps 45:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,5)\">Ps 45:5</ref> <bdbheb>עֶנְוָָֽתְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 18:36\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,36)\">Ps 18:36</ref> (= <bdbheb>עֲנֹתְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:36\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,36)\">2Sam 22:36</ref> see I.  <bdbheb><reflink>ענה</reflink></bdbheb>; read <bdbheb>עֶזְרָֽתְךְ</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ol')\">Ol</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>humility, meekness</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 45:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,5)\">Ps 45:5</r